any.","section":"","block":16,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001213900-26-103044","form":"6-K/A","filedAt":"2026-09-24","reportDate":"2026-09-24","cik":"0001991605","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1991605/000121390026103044/ea030654601ex10-1.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/53c26be43786e2301aceefed565ce3e9ab1b6b6838ebf33826f033e363bd9dae.bin","sha256":"53c26be43786e2301aceefed565ce3e9ab1b6b6838ebf33826f033e363bd9dae"}},{"id":"5722ba4f42f1ada3f69423e458d03f5213fa03743cfcb6bd260a2272d8e8713d","quote":"(2)Subsequent Acquisitions: Based on the business developments after completion of the First Phase acquisition and the Buyer’s business planning, the Buyer shall have the right (but not the obligation) to continue to acquire the remaining equity interests held by the Sellers until the entire equity interest in the Target Company has been acquired. The proportion, consideration and specific terms of any subsequent acquisition shall be negotiated and agreed by the Parties at that time with reference to the overall valuation principles set forth in this Agreement, and shall be set forth in a separate written agreement. If the cumulative proportion of the Target Company’s equity interest acquired by the Buyer exceeds 50% as of any phase, the Sellers shall cooperate in signing the full set of VIE agreements and shall pledge all of the Target Company’s equity interest to the Buyer; the closing conditions precedent, asset and business rectification, performance milestone unlocking, pledge and registration arrangements of the subsequent acquisitions shall, in principle, be implemented by reference to the provisions of this Agreement.","context":"(1)First Phase: Seller One agrees, on the terms and conditions set forth in this Agreement, to sell to the Buyer 33.33% of the equity interest in the Target Company (i.e., 33.33% of the entire equity interest of the Target Company) held by Seller One; and the Buyer agrees to purchase such equity interest on the terms and conditions set forth in this Agreement. Upon completion of the First Phase transaction, the Buyer shall hold 33.33% of the equity interest in the Target Company, Seller One shall hold 50.92% of the equity interest in the Target Company, and Seller Two shall hold 15.75% of the equity interest in the Target Company.","section":"","block":30,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001213900-26-103044","form":"6-K/A","filedAt":"2026-09-24","reportDate":"2026-09-24","cik":"0001991605","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1991605/000121390026103044/ea030654601ex10-1.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/53c26be43786e2301aceefed565ce3e9ab1b6b6838ebf33826f033e363bd9dae.bin","sha256":"53c26be43786e2301aceefed565ce3e9ab1b6b6838ebf33826f033e363bd9dae"}},{"id":"155ea16a41b0547439f4c72fa03f441f2b7fc11507d3658fe94893d0ed7c6477","quote":"3.1 Overall Valuation and Consideration. The Parties confirm that the overall valuation of one hundred percent (100%) of the equity interest in the Target Company is USD 75,000,000 (in words: Seventy-Five Million U.S. Dollars). The consideration for the First Phase under this Agreement is USD 25,000,000 (in words: Twenty-Five Million U.S. Dollars), corresponding to the 33.33% equity interest in the Target Company to be acquired by the Buyer in the First Phase. The consideration for any subsequent acquisition shall be negotiated and agreed by the Parties by reference to the foregoing overall valuation.","context":"Article 3 Consideration and Payment","section":"","block":34,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001213900-26-103044","form":"6-K/A","filedAt":"2026-09-24","reportDate":"2026-09-24","cik":"0001991605","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1991605/000121390026103044/ea030654601ex10-1.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/53c26be43786e2301aceefed565ce3e9ab1b6b6838ebf33826f033e363bd9dae.bin","sha256":"53c26be43786e2301aceefed565ce3e9ab1b6b6838ebf33826f033e363bd9dae"}},{"id":"24fe0d5bac4a0f3e47c1820ac4d3a69d6a3e31d236d3b3237699685a7393f869","quote":"3.7 Failure to Achieve Asset Rectification Targets. If, upon expiration of the Asset and Business Rectification Period, the Sellers have failed to satisfy all conditions set forth in this Agreement, this transaction shall be terminated and the Buyer shall cancel all issued consideration shares. If, upon expiration of the Asset and Business Rectification Period, the transaction cannot be completed and this Agreement is terminated due to reasons attributable to the Buyer (including but not limited to the Buyer’s refusal to issue shares, inability to register the shares as effective, failure of internal approvals of the Buyer, etc.), the Buyer shall pay the Sellers liquidated damages equal to 3% of the transaction consideration. Save for the foregoing, no Party shall bear any liability or obligation to any other Party.","context":"(2)after the lock-up period expires, in any quarter the number of shares transferred shall not exceed 10% of the total consideration shares.","section":"","block":46,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001213900-26-103044","form":"6-K/A","filedAt":"2026-09-24","reportDate":"2026-09-24","cik":"0001991605","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1991605/000121390026103044/ea030654601ex10-1.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/53c26be43786e2301aceefed565ce3e9ab1b6b6838ebf33826f033e363bd9dae.bin","sha256":"53c26be43786e2301aceefed565ce3e9ab1b6b6838ebf33826f033e363bd9dae"}},{"id":"f3c3af365186996d1920a22ae03df630e4ecf0f2bcddcc01091ea27eb6c13d99","quote":"(3)the Buyer has issued the consideration shares to the Sellers in accordance with the provisions of this Agreement.","context":"(2)th